Error [jet.InvalidStatement]: `defer` only schedules a consuming resource close
  --> tests/ui/defer_only_close.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     defer print("not a resource close")
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Jet has no general deferred-action mechanism; resource cleanup stays explicit and ownership-checked through `close`, which takes its resource
 Fix: Write `defer close(resource)`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0003
